# 统一行尾：仓库里一律 LF，检出到 Windows 时也不转换
* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制：不做行尾转换、不做文本 diff
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.webp  binary
*.wav   binary
*.mp3   binary
*.ogg   binary
*.zip   binary
*.dll   binary
*.exe   binary

# 锁文件：diff 里折叠
pnpm-lock.yaml  -diff
package-lock.json -diff

# 文档：GitHub 统计语言时不算进主要语言
*.md linguist-documentation